8.    (Currently Amended) The wearable fetal health monitoring device of claim 1, further comprising one or more of: a MEMS inclinometer, an inertia sensor, and a gyroscope.



9.    (Currently Amended) The wearable fetal health monitoring device of claim 1, further comprising a patch configured to removably attach to the[[a]] maternal torso.



