14.   (Currently Amended) The wearable fetal health monitoring device of claim 1, wherein a first portion of the wearable fetal health monitoring device is disposable, and wherein a second portion of the wearable fetal health monitoring device is re-usable.



15.   (Canceled)



16.   (Currently Amended) The wearable fetal health monitoring device of claim 1, further comprising a noise attenuator configured to: at least partially constructively or destructively combine a first physiological signal component of a first signal output by a first acoustic sensor and a second physiological signal component of a second signal output by a second acoustic sensor.



